<title>THAILAND: Thailand sees 1997 tapioca exports at 4.0 mln tns.</title>
<headline>Thailand sees 1997 tapioca exports at 4.0 mln tns.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai Commerce Minister Narongchai Akrasanee said on Friday that the country's tapioca pellet exports for 1997 were expected to reach four million tonnes.</p>
<p>The government would also liberalise the local system for making tapioca exports to the European Union, he said.</p>
</text>
